1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,480
GTA 6 needs up to 212 gigs. Got room?

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,547
A third of an original PS5. Over half a base Series S.

3
00:00:07,567 --> 00:00:09,413
And it drops this Thursday.

4
00:00:09,433 --> 00:00:12,447
Even the boxed copy is a code. No disc.

5
00:00:12,467 --> 00:00:15,113
Pre-load is already open. Start it tonight.

6
00:00:15,133 --> 00:00:18,080
Rockstar says it unlocks at midnight, local time.

7
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:20,447
It targets thirty frames a second.

8
00:00:20,467 --> 00:00:22,880
Eighty bucks. A hundred for Ultimate.

9
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:25,547
PC players? Nothing announced.

10
00:00:25,567 --> 00:00:28,647
Two delays. Thirteen years since GTA 5.

11
00:00:28,667 --> 00:00:31,347
Send this to the friend who hasn't cleared space.

12
00:00:31,367 --> 00:00:35,547
Follow for launch week, minus the rumors.
